<title>EGYPT: SQUASH-GEZIRA OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-GEZIRA OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the Gezira Open squash championship (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Played on Monday:</p>
<p>7-Mark Chaloner (England) beat Julian Wellings (England) 15-12 15-7 15-11</p>
<p>2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat Omar El Borolossy (Egypt) 12-15 15-14 15-10 15-6</p>
<p>Zubair Jahan Khan (Pakistan) beat Alex Gough (Wales) 13-15 15-8 15-4 15-4</p>
<p>6-Chris Walker (England) beat Dan Jenson (Australia) 15-10 11-15 15-8 15-9.</p>
</text>
